SECTION 3: AGENT PIPELINE
===============================================================================

3.1 ORDER (strict)
  ContextSentinel → CascadeAnalyzer → CircuitBreaker → FixArchitect → MBOMEngine

3.2 MODELS
  gemini-3.6-flash  → Sentinel, Cascade, Breaker
  gemini-3.1-pro-preview → Fix, MBOM

3.3 FRAMEWORK
  google.antigravity.Agent + LocalAgentConfig + CapabilitiesConfig
  Auth: gcloud ADC only — never hardcode keys.

